hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1774","[AI-translation] Us mein Ibn Masood ki hadees hai jo Surat-ur-Room mein guzar chuki hai. Is riwayat mein badhaa diya: Unhon-ne kaha: (Ae hamaarey Rab! Ham se azaab khol dey, beshak ham imaan laaney waley hain). To us se kaha gaya: Agar ham un se kholen to wo wapas aaein. To us ne apne Rab se dua ki aur us ne un se khol diya. To wo wapas aey aur Allah ne un se Badr key din badla liya. (Bukhari: 4822). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur hamein zamana key siwa halaak nahi karta)."
"1775","[AI-translation] Us mein Ibn Masood ki hadees hai jo Surat-ur-Room mein guzar chuki hai. Is riwayat mein badhaa diya: Unhon-ne kaha: (Ae hamaarey Rab! Ham se azaab khol dey, beshak ham imaan laaney waley hain). To us se kaha gaya: Agar ham un se kholen to wo wapas aaein. To us ne apne Rab se dua ki aur us ne un se khol diya. To wo wapas aey aur Allah ne un se Badr key din badla liya. (Bukhari: 4822). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur hamein zamana key siwa halaak nahi karta)."
